Weighted hover, 120 frames x 30 ms = 3.6 s, one bob per loop. Driver: the body bobs HOVER_PX (broad crest, quick trough: hangs at the top, turns fast at the bottom) with a small sideways drift and a pendulum rock about the waist. Everything else trails: the four upper arms bend after the bob (ARM_LAG, outer joints later), the eight lower arms later still (LEG_LAG), the hanging pendant swings last (PEND_LAG). The tall S-curved top flame trails the rock with a lag growing up the chain, plus its own travelling flutter (3 per loop). Candle flames flutter fast and light (3 per loop), each out of phase. All periods divide the loop: seamless.
